Task: prepare web client demo with real auth
Context:
- Demo must no longer surface seed data; it needs real OIDC + API wiring with HTTPS/JWKS enforcement and health-checked deployment.
Position:
- Enforce config completeness when sync is on (issuer, client, audience, endpoints, jwks); reject insecure URLs except localhost; verify JWT signatures before state sync.
